      "content": "thanks for that. i want to dig deeper into the instability part. if we're looking at the transition period, how much of a risk is there to the stability of the national power grid and the overall reliability of energy costs for heavy industry? i'm hearing a lot of experts say this kind of rapid shift is basically a recipe for deindustrialization.",
